   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> ValueOr <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_00934\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_00934]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00130\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00130</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;typename U&gt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">T</a> ValueOr (U &amp;&amp;defaultValue) &amp;&amp;noexcept(<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::is_nothrow_move_ constructible</a>&lt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">T</a> &gt;::value &amp;&amp;<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_constructible\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::is_nothrow_constructible</a>&lt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">T</a>, U &amp;&amp; &gt;::value);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Return a copy of the referred-to value or the given default value. If *this contains a value, it is returned. Otherwise, the specified default value is returned, static_ cast’d to T.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
